{"file_path":"/home/john/mynotes/deterministic_equidistribution_theory/c_suite/src/exp_fourier_compare.c","new_string":"        /* baseline = principal character on units (chi_0: 1 on units, 0 on\n         * non-units), the apples-to-apples trivial sector for multiplicative\n         * characters. (Using the full trivial operator would mix in non-unit\n         * residues that the chi sectors never see.) */\n        ldbl rho0_s0 = 0, rho0_s1 = 0;\n        for (int pass = 0; pass < 2; pass++) {\n            ldbl s = pass ? 1.0L : 0.0L;\n            character_t ch0; char_make_mult_3r(&ch0, Q, 0);\n            csr_t A0; operator_info_t i0;\n            rhg_build(&A0, &i0, Q, 0, 0, c->bmax, s, &ch0, 0);\n            ldbl r = csr_spectral_radius(&A0, MAXIT, TOL, RESTARTS, NULL, NULL);\n            if (pass) rho0_s1 = r; else rho0_s0 = r;\n            csr_free(&A0); char_free(&ch0);\n        }","old_string":"        /* trivial-sector residue-only rho at s=0 and s=1 */\n        ldbl rho0_s0 = 0, rho0_s1 = 0;\n        for (int pass = 0; pass < 2; pass++) {\n            ldbl s = pass ? 1.0L : 0.0L;\n            csr_t A0; operator_info_t i0;\n            rhg_build(&A0, &i0, Q, 0, 0, c->bmax, s, NULL, 0);\n            ldbl r = csr_spectral_radius(&A0, MAXIT, TOL, RESTARTS, NULL, NULL);\n            if (pass) rho0_s1 = r; else rho0_s0 = r;\n            csr_free(&A0);\n        }","replace_all":false}